        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Laujiu Nah rianramei jaolo,",
            "Theilou nimei chingbut thang duang tatna;",
            "Rianra nkhalou nimei meih makge,",
            "Rianra khangmei pu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He poubaunei rianra khalounimei mak,",
            "Kalvari chingbut thang njuan tatna;",
            "Meipui meina lung rianra,",
            "Kapma han dat the.",
            "",
            "2. Theilou nimei ching guang tanga,",
            "Akum nicho apoubaumei ta hei;",
            "Kaphai kaban hianbin lou kross rukhou,",
            "Houmumei nun %&6.",
            "",
            "3. Jaona rianra mak khang mak ge,",
            "He di nthuknga thei lou kanmei tei;",
            "Kajei nthanmei jei %&6 luangliam lou,",
            "Nangni guang jaolo.",
            "",
            "4. Poubaumei jei pat lou khou %&6,",
            "Kandihmei ta pap khou thuaklou the;",
            "Tingkauh kai changmun tei lan lou the,",
            "Kamei nun guai khang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
